{"title":"Boneyard Vulture","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 36 Vulture that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 4 times (8.0% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: diveSpeedMult: 1.6</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/vulture-eye\">Vulture Eye</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=35\">Lv 35 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=36\">Lv 36 <span>25</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=37\">Lv 37 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=38\">Lv 38 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=39\">Lv 39 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=40\">Lv 40 <span>6</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=35\" title=\"Pick level 35\"><td><b>35</b></td><td>152</td><td>23.8</td><td>1,750</td><td class=\"muted\">456 · 33.3 · 5,250</td><td>8</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Boneyard%20Roost\">Boneyard Roost</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=36\" title=\"Pick level 36\"><td><b>36</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>160</td><td>24.3</td><td>1,800</td><td class=\"muted\">480 · 34 · 5,400</td><td>25</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=37\" title=\"Pick level 37\"><td><b>37</b></td><td>168</td><td>24.9</td><td>1,850</td><td class=\"muted\">504 · 34.9 · 5,550</td><td>8</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=38\" title=\"Pick level 38\"><td><b>38</b></td><td>176</td><td>25.4</td><td>1,900</td><td class=\"muted\">528 · 35.6 · 5,700</td><td>4</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>39</b></td><td>185</td><td>26</td><td>1,950</td><td class=\"muted\">555 · 36.4 · 5,850</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/boneyard-vulture?lv=40\" title=\"Pick level 40\"><td><b>40</b></td><td>194</td><td>26.5</td><td>2,000</td><td class=\"muted\">582 · 37.1 · 6,000</td><td>6</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"boneyard-vulture\" data-map-level=\"39\">Show level 39 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 2 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"boneyard-plume\" title=\"Boneyard Plume - in 100% of 2 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9444da4e263965d6ad40.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Boneyard Plume</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 2/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"vulture-quill\" title=\"Vulture Quill - in 50% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 6 total, 6 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/90d5c9480dcb277fd232.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Vulture Quill</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 1/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"carrion-beak\" title=\"Carrion Beak - in 50% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 5 total, 5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7a49c56e82348ad182a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Carrion Beak</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 1/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"vulture-eye\" title=\"Vulture Eye - in 50% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cd1a5737dc8b89264cc.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Vulture Eye</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 1/2</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 26 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Boneyard%20Roost\">Boneyard Roost</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 10 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Vanguard%20Camp\">Thak Vanguard Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Dune%20Raider%20Stronghold\">Dune Raider Stronghold</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"boneyard-vulture\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/old-bonebeak\"><img src=\"data/img/848c5b3078e044665e81.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Old Bonebeak</b><span>Lv 37</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Vulture: <a href=\"#/monster/carrion-vulture\">Carrion Vulture</a> <span class=\"muted\">(30)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/giant-vulture\">Giant Vulture</a> <span class=\"muted\">(33)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/848c5b3078e044665e81.webp\" alt=\"Boneyard Vulture\"></div><h3>Boneyard Vulture</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>39</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 36)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Vulture</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>185</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>26</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,950</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.0 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n 